.96,"end":66.77,"text":"幻想郷にバス無い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":66.77,"end":72.16,"text":"ヤマオチ意味などないわ キャラクター立てばいいのよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":72.16,"end":74.96000000000001,"text":"元気があればなんでも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":74.96000000000001,"end":77.27,"text":"1, 2, 9!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":77.27,"end":82.73,"text":"くるくる時計の針 ぐるぐる頭回る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":82.73,"end":85.9,"text":"だってつぶら目玉二つしかないのに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":85.9,"end":88.13,"text":"三本の針なんてちんぷんかん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":88.13,"end":93.85,"text":"次々問題出る まだまだ授業続く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":93.85,"end":95.65,"text":"凍る部屋の中","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":95.65,"end":98.28,"text":"ひんやりした温度も 時間も気にせず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":98.28,"end":99.72999999999999,"text":"ゆっくりしていってね！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":99.72999999999999,"end":103.63,"text":"ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":103.63,"end":105.15,"text":"\"だから、ばかじゃないって言ってるでしょ\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":105.15,"end":109.00999999999999,"text":"ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":109.00999999999999,"end":110.89,"text":"\"いい加減にしないと冷凍するわよ\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":110.89,"end":114.47,"text":"ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":114.47,"end":116.22,"text":"\"そして粉々になって死ねばいいのよ\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":116.22,"end":121.54,"text":"ばーかばーか ばーかばーか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":121.54,"end":126.93,"text":"霊夢とこの百万円のつぼを誰かが割っちゃった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":126.93,"end":132.62,"text":"永遠亭のえーりんが弁償しに来ましたよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","sta